                              "key": "workspace",
                              "value": "<string>",
                              "description": "(Required) "
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "Returns the flat list of all item paths visible to the caller across\nscripts, flows, apps, raw apps, variables, and resources. Intended to\nfeed an entirely client-side path autocomplete UI: the frontend fetches\nonce (server caches per workspace for 60s) and performs all prefix/segment\ncomputation locally. Capped at 20,000 paths (5,000 per table).\n"
                      },
